1	Create project structure	Python project organization
2	Implement base.py	Interfaces and abstraction
3	Implement vllm_backend.py	API communication
4	Implement image_processing.py	Image handling
5	Implement identification.py	Prompt construction and inference
6	Implement output.py	Structured results and serialization
7	Implement main.py	Application orchestration
8	Test with bird photographs	End-to-end VLM inference



